  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:yizkor_elohim_et">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/1"/>God will remember His covenant
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/2"/>with Abraham, with Isaac
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/3"/>and with Jacob.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/4"/>“I have sworn by Myself,” declares Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/5"/>“That because you performed
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/6"/>this deed
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/7"/>and did not withhold
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/8"/>your only son,
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:genesis/22/17"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/9"/>I will bless you greatly
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/10"/>and make your descendants numerous
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/11"/>as the stars of the sky
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/12"/>and as the sand on the seashore,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/13"/>and your descendants will inherit
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/14"/>the gate of their enemies.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:genesis/22/18"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/15"/>Through your children, will be blessed
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/16"/>all the nations of the world
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yizkor_elohim_et/17"/>because you heeded my voice.”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
